  "solution": "**Logic: Third no. = [(First no. × Second no.) × 2]**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**3 - 4 - 24 →**\n\n​⇒ [(3 × 4) × 2]\n\n​⇒ (12 × 2) = 24\n\n**4 - 7- 56 →**\n\n​⇒ [(4 × 7) × 2]\n\n​⇒ (28 × 2) = 56\n\nChecking the given options:\n\n**(1) **9 - 12 - 54 →\n\n​⇒ [(9 × 12) × 2]\n\n​⇒ (108 × 2) = 216\n\n**(2) **8 - 7 - 53 →\n\n​⇒ [(8 × 7) × 2]\n\n​⇒ (56 × 2) = 112\n\n**(3) **2 - 3 - 18 →\n\n​⇒ [(2 × 3) × 2]\n\n​⇒ (6 × 2) = 12\n\n**(4)** 5 - 8 - 80 →\n\n​⇒ [(5 × 8) × 2]\n\n​⇒ (40 × 2) = 80\n\nHere, **'****5 - 8 - 80' **is similar to the given sets of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (4)\".\n\n2f:Tc3d,\n\n<",
